 "inference": [
  "Which items sprint fast is a source fact: the abilities of the five knife-type melee weapons in the current build (and the Dive Knife in 1.4.3.0), the defibrillator and the repair tool each reference FastSprintRequired once; the Sledgehammer ability does not. This is the same list the videos and the operator report.",
  "Field_1a2b6380 and Field_e4506828 of the pose entry are the walk and sprint speed of the pose: the standing entry reads 3.5 and 6.05, the published values.",
  "The fast speed 7.15 is within measurement error of 2.05 x 3.5 (FastSprintTopSpeedMultiplier on the walk speed) and equals 1.1 x 6.5; the Sledgehammer's 6.5 equals 1.857 x 3.5 (DefaultStandSprintTopSpeedMultiplier). The numbers fit a reading in which melee-type items sprint at walk speed times a multiplier while guns use the pose sprint speed, but the equation is not read from source.",
  "L4013's statement that no stored value gives the bonus is superseded for the selection (the channel) and narrowed for the size (candidates above)."
 ],
 "unresolved": [
  "Why guns sprint at 6.05 and the Sledgehammer at 6.5; the Sledgehammer was measured at 6.05 in November 2025 and 6.5 in July 2026, so a change between those dates is likely but not found in the saved patch notes.",
  "The LMG 5 percent penalty and the adrenaline 10 percent boost have no identified operand; ImproviserSprintIncrease and SERETrainingSprintIncrease (both 1.1) are candidates by value only.",
  "The role of the pose entry storing 7.15 / 7.15.",
  "The measurements are third-party and up to 11 months old."
 ],
